    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_right_sidebar\"><ac:layout-cell><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"note\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"21fa014e-a62f-4fec-9b26-3c648475e19e\"><ac:rich-text-body><p><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">The following steps and screenshots are explained as per </span><strong style=\"\">Odoo 10</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">, available on </span><strong style=\"\">Bahmni 0.92</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\"> release.</span></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h3 style=\"\">1. Search a confirmed sale order and Print the Invoice in Odoo</h3><ol class=\"ak-ol\" style=\"\"><li><p>Go to &ldquo;Sales Order&rdquo; screen under &ldquo;Sales&rdquo; section from &ldquo;Sales&rdquo; menu in &ldquo;Odoo&rdquo;.<br /><br /><ac:image ac:border=\"true\" ac:height=\"250\" ac:width=\"810\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image2020-4-20_20-43-18.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></p></li><li><p>Search a desired confirmed sale order record and click on the same to view the details.</p></li><li>If the invoice has already been created for the order, an &quot;Invoices&quot; icon/button will appear in the top right corner of the screen.<br /><br /><ac:image ac:border=\"true\" ac:height=\"400\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image2020-4-20_20-34-18.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image><br /><br /></li><li>Click on the &quot;Invoices&quot; icon/button to view the Invoice Details</li><li>Now to print the Invoice/Bill, click on &quot;Print&quot; button appearing at the top of the screen and chose &quot;Invoices&quot; option from the drop down.<br /><br /><ac:image ac:border=\"true\" ac:height=\"400\" ac:width=\"712\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image2020-4-20_20-29-46.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></li><li>This will download the Invoice in PDF format as shown in below screenshot.<ac:image ac:height=\"452\" ac:width=\"644\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image2020-4-20_20-20-52.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></li></ol><p><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"note\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"007b8f2b-ca68-44a4-9076-c9f61d4359ed\"><ac:rich-text-body><p><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">The following steps and screenshots are explained as per </span><strong style=\"\">OpenERP</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">, available on releases before&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"\">Bahmni 0.92</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">.</span></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">1.&nbsp;Login to OpenERP application</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Click on &ldquo;Sales&rdquo; from the top menu. Choose &ldquo;Quotations&rdquo; from the left panel.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">If the bahmni-erp-connect service is running and the OpenMRS to ERP sync is functional, then the screen will display the patient in the list for whom medications and test were orders as in screenshot below.</span></p><p><ac:image ac:width=\"800\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Screen Shot 2017-06-18 at 11.05.04 PM.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></p><p><br /></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">2. Select &ldquo;Sales Order&rdquo; from the left panel a display as in screenshot below is presented.</span></p><p><ac:image ac:width=\"800\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Screen Shot 2017-06-18 at 11.28.30 PM.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></p><p><br /></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">3. Select the patient from the list to &ldquo;View Invoice&rdquo;.</span></p><p><ac:image ac:width=\"800\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Screen Shot 2017-06-18 at 11.28.48 PM.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">4. From the &ldquo;View Invoice&rdquo; screen choose &ldquo;Print Invoice&rdquo; to print the bill for the customer.</span></p><p><ac:image ac:width=\"800\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Screen Shot 2017-06-18 at 11.29.11 PM.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><br /></span></p></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"600d29bf-fc08-48b0-8dfa-c9a5e4f20526\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#1FA5A0</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Related Links</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"children\" ac:schema-version=\"2\" ac:macro-id=\"b988d0de-81e6-414b-b6e2-8bbbb5a8efca\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"all\">true</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"page\"><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Billing and Accounting\" ri:version-at-save=\"8\" /></ac:link></ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"0add60ca-db50-405a-bfd6-90945fbc2b0b\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#668D3C</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Feature Details</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Patient Billing and Accounting\" ri:version-at-save=\"10\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[Billing and Accounting - Feature Guide]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link></span></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"55de8170-c071-4602-aacf-72d73bdf438e\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#668D3C</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Implementation Details</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Accounting Configuration\" ri:version-at-save=\"12\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[Billing and Accounting - Implementer's Guide]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link>&nbsp;(OpenERP7)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Odoo Accounting Configuration\" ri:version-at-save=\"8\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[Accounting Configuration - Implementer's Guide]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link> (Odoo)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Odoo Sales Configuration\" ri:version-at-save=\"10\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[Sales Configuration - Implementer's Guide]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link> (Odoo)</span></span></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section></ac:layout>",
