    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"21fa014e-a62f-4fec-9b26-3c648475e19e\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-blue3\">The following steps and screenshots are explained as per </span><strong style=\"\">Odoo 10</strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-blue3\">, available on </span><strong style=\"\">Bahmni 0.92</strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-blue3\"> release.</span></p></div></div><h3 style=\"\" id=\"PrintBillandPrescription-1.SearchaconfirmedsaleorderandPrinttheInvoiceinOdoo\">1. Search a confirmed sale order and Print the Invoice in Odoo</h3><ol style=\"\" class=\"ak-ol\"><li><p>Go to “Sales Order” screen under “Sales” section from “Sales” menu in “Odoo”.<br/><br/><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" height=\"250\" width=\"810\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014612/image2020-4-20_20-43-18.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1587395600890&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=810&amp;height=249\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014612/image2020-4-20_20-43-18.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1587395600890&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"1232338973\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2020-4-20_20-43-18.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014612\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"7\" data-media-id=\"e6571a22-d5c5-4296-ba9b-335cf77e0cf0\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014612/image2020-4-20_20-43-18.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1587395600890&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=998&amp;height=308 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014612/image2020-4-20_20-43-18.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1587395600890&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=810&amp;height=249 1x\"></span></p></li><li><p>Search a desired confirmed sale order record and click on the same to view the details.</p></li><li>If the invoice has already been created for the order, an &quot;Invoices&quot; icon/button will appear in the top right corner of the screen.<br/><br/><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" height=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014612/image2020-4-20_20-34-18.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1587395060989&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=635&amp;height=400\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014612/image2020-4-20_20-34-18.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1587395060989&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"1232338962\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2020-4-20_20-34-18.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014612\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"7\" data-media-id=\"dfc021bc-9c67-402a-87bb-ff79e489a7c9\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014612/image2020-4-20_20-34-18.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1587395060989&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=855&amp;height=538 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014612/image2020-4-20_20-34-18.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1587395060989&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=635&amp;height=400 1x\"></span><br/><br/></li><li>Click on the &quot;Invoices&quot; icon/button to view the Invoice Details</li><li>Now to print the Invoice/Bill, click on &quot;Print&quot; button appearing at the top of the screen and chose &quot;Invoices&quot; option from the drop down.<br/><br/><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" height=\"400\" width=\"712\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014612/image2020-4-20_20-29-46.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1587394788667&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=712&amp;height=400\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014612/image2020-4-20_20-29-46.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1587394788667&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"1232142386\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2020-4-20_20-29-46.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014612\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"7\" data-media-id=\"b5d19050-a9b3-4cde-b31b-a2cec98f5b59\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014612/image2020-4-20_20-29-46.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1587394788667&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=849&amp;height=477 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014612/image2020-4-20_20-29-46.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1587394788667&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=712&amp;height=400 1x\"></span></li><li>This will download the Invoice in PDF format as shown in below screenshot.<span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"452\" width=\"644\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014612/image2020-4-20_20-20-52.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1587394255319&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=644&amp;height=452\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014612/image2020-4-20_20-20-52.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1587394255319&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"1232240674\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2020-4-20_20-20-52.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014612\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"7\" data-media-id=\"ca92b095-2ca3-4e43-b3cc-6339462da808\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014612/image2020-4-20_20-20-52.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1587394255319&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=644&amp;height=452 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014612/image2020-4-20_20-20-52.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1587394255319&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=644&amp;height=452 1x\"></span></li></ol><p><br/></p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"007b8f2b-ca68-44a4-9076-c9f61d4359ed\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-blue3\">The following steps and screenshots are explained as per </span><strong style=\"\">OpenERP</strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-blue3\">, available on releases before </span><strong style=\"\">Bahmni 0.92</strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-blue3\">.</span></p></div></div><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">1. Login to OpenERP application</span></strong></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Click on “Sales” from the top menu. Choose “Quotations” from the left panel.</span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">If the bahmni-erp-connect service is running and the OpenMRS to ERP sync is functional, then the screen will display the patient in the list for whom medications and test were orders as in screenshot below.</span></p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014612/Screen%20Shot%202017-06-18%20at%2011.05.04%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1497808798763&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=800&amp;height=364\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014612/Screen%20Shot%202017-06-18%20at%2011.05.04%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1497808798763&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"117308321\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2017-06-18 at 11.05.04 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014612\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"7\" data-media-id=\"dd265613-9ad3-4b33-9c5f-b66f9ca3f993\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014612/Screen%20Shot%202017-06-18%20at%2011.05.04%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1497808798763&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1600&amp;height=728 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014612/Screen%20Shot%202017-06-18%20at%2011.05.04%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1497808798763&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=800&amp;height=364 1x\"></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">2. Select “Sales Order” from the left panel a display as in screenshot below is presented.</span></p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014612/Screen%20Shot%202017-06-18%20at%2011.28.30%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1497808810005&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=800&amp;height=483\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014612/Screen%20Shot%202017-06-18%20at%2011.28.30%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1497808810005&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"117308340\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2017-06-18 at 11.28.30 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014612\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"7\" data-media-id=\"2f7bc230-217b-490a-ae2e-6ff78efc7778\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014612/Screen%20Shot%202017-06-18%20at%2011.28.30%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1497808810005&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1600&amp;height=966 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014612/Screen%20Shot%202017-06-18%20at%2011.28.30%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1497808810005&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=800&amp;height=483 1x\"></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">3. Select the patient from the list to “View Invoice”.</span></p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014612/Screen%20Shot%202017-06-18%20at%2011.28.48%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1497808811049&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=800&amp;height=491\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014612/Screen%20Shot%202017-06-18%20at%2011.28.48%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1497808811049&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"117308351\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2017-06-18 at 11.28.48 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014612\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"7\" data-media-id=\"8d341af1-4c94-4b71-8ee3-299c30e55a92\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014612/Screen%20Shot%202017-06-18%20at%2011.28.48%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1497808811049&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1600&amp;height=982 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014612/Screen%20Shot%202017-06-18%20at%2011.28.48%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1497808811049&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=800&amp;height=491 1x\"></span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><br/></span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">4. From the “View Invoice” screen choose “Print Invoice” to print the bill for the customer.</span></p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014612/Screen%20Shot%202017-06-18%20at%2011.29.11%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1497808811998&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=800&amp;height=536\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014612/Screen%20Shot%202017-06-18%20at%2011.29.11%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1497808811998&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"117308362\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2017-06-18 at 11.29.11 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014612\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"7\" data-media-id=\"3ef19be2-7c36-4b74-885c-527054a57154\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014612/Screen%20Shot%202017-06-18%20at%2011.29.11%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1497808811998&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1584&amp;height=1062 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014612/Screen%20Shot%202017-06-18%20at%2011.29.11%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1497808811998&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=800&amp;height=536 1x\"></span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><br/></span></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"600d29bf-fc08-48b0-8dfa-c9a5e4f20526\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"b